Z||000008||Formula88||03-30-2001||12:43 AM||||What version of Windoze?  Is it 98 Second Edition?  If it's regular 98, it's buggy.  Upgrade to Second Edition.  I'd stay away from Millenniuum.  It's major bloatware.  If you have a full install CD, you can do an install over top of your existing build.  If it gives you an error saying this is for full installs only and you need an upgrade CD, delete the win.com file and try again.  COPY IT TO A DISKETTE FIRST, SO YOU CAN BACK OUT, IF NEED BE.  You should also have all the CD's files already on your HDD, if it's a factory preload.  It's usually in c:\windows\options\cabs , but if not, do a search for *.cab.  That folder, and all it's subfolders can be burnt to a CD and you now have a Windows install CD.  Don't forget to make a startup diskette first, so you can get your cdrom drivers to load!  <P>Other than that, what apps are you running when you get the crash?  If it only crashes when certain apps are running, try re-installing them.<P>I usually have to rebuild my system once or twice a year, but that's because I play with it constantly and the build gets pretty cluttered after a while.  If you can make a backup that'll fit on a CD, that makes your life much easier in the future.  That's what I did.  ||||reg||1
Z||000009||tgowens||03-30-2001||03:44 AM||||Black88GT, one other thing you can do is to do an internet search for the two .dll files that are giving you a problem........there are several programs that will cause a crash in Kernel32.dll.........here are some links that you can download .dll files from and you might want to download those two and replace the ones on your HD with newer versions......<P> <A HREF="http://www.nocrash.com/dll.shtml" TARGET=_blank>http://www.nocrash.com/dll.shtml</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://dllstar.hypermart.net/" TARGET=_blank>http://dllstar.hypermart.net/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.internet-help.net/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.internet-help.net/</A> <P>also, check out the Windows 98 annoyances site....<P> <A HREF="http://www.annoyances.org/win98/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.annoyances.org/win98/</A> <P>Hope this helps.........||||reg||1
